  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.14 Facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.14 “Facilities” means any building, enclosure, space, or structure used for the confinement of persons committed to the custody of the commissioner, or for any other matter related to such confinement.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (formerly Cor 101.12) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
